   PUBLIC API — MODEL EXAM OF THE DAY (schema v3)
   One fixed paper per calendar date: the same questions in the same order for
   every student, one attempt each, daily leaderboard + rank, 7-day history,
   optional autopilot via a time-driven trigger at MODEL_AUTO_HOUR.
